Z||000000||Tigger||04-19-2001||01:22 AM||||   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tigfoolupsidedown.jpg">   <P>I get the front end all back together on my Fiero, bolt on the wheels, drop the jack, and took a stand back for a moment then suddenly realized that I had put my new 2" drop spindles on upside down.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><P>I though for sure the spindle axis was supposed to be lower than the original axis in order to lower the car, right?  Awe man...    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>j/k, hehe, can't wait to get it off jackstands, should be finished soon.   It's late and the Wing's game is on.<p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 04-19-2001).]||||reg||11
