Z||000019||strdream||05-14-2001||10:42 AM||||Sorry for reviving a month-old thread, this one piqued my interest.<P>Can you post some real pictures?  Did you manage to get the 4" drop done and actually drive it?  How well does the overall drop work?<P>We did get a request from another person asking if a 3" drop would work.  Although it may have meant more work overall, I suggested to that person that he might want to do a 2" drop first, drive it for a while to make sure the car works with speed bumps in the area before going any farther.  He agreed that it was a good idea to go that way first.<p>[This message has been edited by strdream (edited 05-14-2001).]||||reg||1
